      "name": "Лечебное зелье",
      "subject": "ONE squat round clear glass medicine bottle with short neck and plain cork, filled two-thirds with muted coral red liquid. A wide clear horizontal meniscus, controlled upper-left glass glint, visible transparent empty neck. Plain modest bottle; no heart shape, heart decal, label, metal neck collar, pendant or magical glow. Upright silhouette."
    },
    {
      "id": "axe",
